# Editing cells of the table view: each edit is one set-field on the workspace copy, which
# tests/drive.rs then reads. A value that doesn't fit and a read-only column are refused with
# their reason; an edit to the row's key (the VEI) keeps the row selected under its new id.
size 160x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
keys i
wait-for Table of…
type erup
wait-for 1 of 4 rows · /erup
keys enter
wait-for 4 rows
keys j j l e
wait-for example: [[Krakatoa]] 1883▏
keys ctrl+u
type [[Krakatoa]] 1883, Sunda Strait
keys enter
wait-for Volcanic Explosivity Index: example set to [[Krakatoa]] 1883, Sunda Strait
wait-for [[Krakatoa]] 1883, Sunda Strait
keys h e ctrl+u
type big
keys enter
wait-for not saved: vei: "big" is not a number
keys l l e
wait-for volcanoes is read-only
keys h h e ctrl+u
type 7
keys enter
wait-for vei set to 7
wait-for  7   [[Krakatoa]] 1883, Sunda Strait
keys enter
wait-for Volcanic Explosivity Index (VEI)  reading
keys i
wait-for Table of…
type task
wait-for 1 of 4 rows · /task
keys enter
wait-for rows
keys /
type lahars
keys enter
wait-for 1 of 17 rows · /lahars
keys l l l e
wait-for due: ▏
type 2026-12-01
keys enter
wait-for due set to 2026-12-01
keys h h e ctrl+u
type done
keys enter
wait-for status_type set to done
wait-for 2026-12-01
screen
keys q q
exits 0
